{"id":"wb-6-758","name":"双龙桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"双龙桥","text":"双龙桥，俗称十七孔桥，位于中华人民共和国云南省红河哈尼族彝族自治州建水县西庄镇水打营村北200米，是17孔大型石拱桥，横跨泸江、塔冲河（旧称塌村河）交汇的水面之上，因两水所交而得名。被建设部城市规划司、国家文物局称为云南古石桥中规模最大、艺术价值最高的一座，在中国桥梁史上占有重要地位，现为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E9%BE%99%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":94382346,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94382346","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8ec7ed841fbdd7095ae2f70f.jpg","title":"双龙桥_-_2025-05-04_14.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8F%8C%E9%BE%99%E6%A1%A5_-_2025-05-04_14.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/%E5%8F%8C%E9%BE%99%E6%A1%A5_-_2025-05-04_14.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"瑞丽江的河水","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​ 双龙桥，位于中国云南省建水县，中国古代桥梁的杰作，于18世纪始建为三孔桥，1839年扩展为十七孔桥。","width":320,"height":240}}